      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S ALL FIRE (1) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Was a bit beyond her last time when seventh (30.80) over 520m at Q Parklands in a OPEN but is better suited here over less ground. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won three of five tries. Comes out of a hot form race last start. Rates on top in this line up. UNWORLDLY (6) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 19.00 beating Hey Ernie. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to his name from five starts. Has definite claims. CAKE IS GREAT (2) finished well back at Q Lakeside last time when a 32 length eighth (23.67) but scored three back at Q Lakeside (21.69). Has a strong record here at this journey including six wins. Form from his last run is proving strong. Worth following up. OUR BOY CHOPPER (4) jumps at a shorter trip and still warrants respect.",
